    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quotes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Pope - <i>&quot;I enjoyed every minute of the demo - great art, setup, mood, mechanics -- the lot&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alasdair Beckett - <i>&quot;A much-needed reminder of a time when Nazis were universally despised&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1971. A dead priest. A list of Nazi fugitives. The hunt begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Catholic priest is found murdered in Budapest, a secret list is discovered \u2014names of Nazi war criminals who escaped justice through a covert network known as <i>The Ratline</i>. Now, the case is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gritty detective thriller set in 1971, you play an investigator chasing shadows across continents. Use your wits, intuition, and network of contacts to follow leads, dig through documents, and piece together the truth\u2014before the trail goes cold forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine</strong> documents, photographs, and recovered artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make independent deductions</strong> with no hand-holding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/12cd0c62f203445847b4d4e2fe862d86.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/12cd0c62f203445847b4d4e2fe862d86.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/12cd0c62f203445847b4d4e2fe862d86.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Act like a proper sleuth</strong>, working contacts and shaking down sources from Rome to Buenos Aires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/e20f947ab89ede004cf416812e7d1700.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/e20f947ab89ede004cf416812e7d1700.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/e20f947ab89ede004cf416812e7d1700.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down your marks -\u00a0</strong>put together their identities, check your work and bring them to justice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/f686c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/f686c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/f686c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by Owlskip</strong>, the studio behind acclaimed narrative detective games <i>Family</i>, <i>Rivals</i>, <i>Conspiracy</i>, <i>Echo Beach</i>, <i>Life &amp; Crimes</i>, and <i>Riley and Rochelle</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The war may be over\u2014but the reckoning has just begun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ratline</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quotes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas Pope - <i>&quot;I enjoyed every minute of the demo - great art, setup, mood, mechanics -- the lot&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alasdair Beckett - <i>&quot;A much-needed reminder of a time when Nazis were universally despised&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1971. A dead priest. A list of Nazi fugitives. The hunt begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Catholic priest is found murdered in Budapest, a secret list is discovered \u2014names of Nazi war criminals who escaped justice through a covert network known as <i>The Ratline</i>. Now, the case is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gritty detective thriller set in 1971, you play an investigator chasing shadows across continents. Use your wits, intuition, and network of contacts to follow leads, dig through documents, and piece together the truth\u2014before the trail goes cold forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine</strong> documents, photographs, and recovered artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/7477763a0ccde62de01d1f4ae3051e5c.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str