c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.poster.avif?t=1751028699\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/f686c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.webm?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756940/extras/f686c11f5a8f482df7ae9795a3be6231.mp4?t=1751028699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by Owlskip</strong>, the studio behind acclaimed narrative detective games <i>Family</i>, <i>Rivals</i>, <i>Conspiracy</i>, <i>Echo Beach</i>, <i>Life &amp; Crimes</i>, and <i>Riley and Rochelle</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The war may be over\u2014but the reckoning has just begun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ratline</p>",
